Subject: [PATCH 04/10] naive spellbook integration

Adds inline spell-checking via the helix-editor/spellbook library.
Misspelled words are highlighted with diagnostic.error on every render.
This is a prototype: a real implementation would run incrementally in
the background and surface results as proper diagnostics.
